WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.110
One verse of the Qur'an
seems to close the door:

2
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.910
a religion other than Islam
will never be accepted.

3
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:11.780
Yet another verse promises Jews, Christians
and Sabians who believe in God and

4
00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:14.760
do good their reward with their Lord.

5
00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:18.700
And Muslims honour Abraham,
Moses and Jesus as prophets,

6
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.870
making no distinction among them.

7
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:25.310
So can a Muslim still believe that
people of other faiths may be saved?

8
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.880
In this mission, you'll map
three positions on salvation:

9
00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:32.650
exclusivism, inclusivism and pluralism.

10
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.910
Then you'll weigh the verses
and scholars each side uses,

11
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:39.380
and judge whether Islam is
an exclusivist religion.

12
00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:42.930
Your mission: find out how
Muslims weigh these verses,

13
00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:45.950
and whether God's reward
can reach beyond Islam.
